{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a new premium comparison section for a Shopify landing page, visually consistent with the Ahinsa campaign style.
    
    Section purpose
    
    Help users choose between Barefoot and Comfort shoes.
    
    Content structure
    
    At the top of the section:
    
    Main heading: “Barefoot nebo Comfort?”
    Subheading: “Vyberte si boty podle toho, jak chcete chodit.”
    Supporting text:
    “Obě řady spojuje to nejdůležitější: anatomicky prostorná špička, nulový podpatek a návrh od fyzioterapeutů. Rozdíl je hlavně v tom, jak moc chcete cítit zem pod sebou.”
    
    Below this intro, create 2 side-by-side comparison cards:
    
    left card = Barefoot
    right card = Comfort
    Important design requirement
    
    The labels BAREFOOT and COMFORT must be visually emphasized as a real badge / pill / label, not plain text.
    
    Each badge should:
    
    sit at the top of each card
    have rounded corners
    include a small icon or dot on the left
    use stronger contrast than the body text
    feel premium and editorial
    
    Suggested styling:
    
    Barefoot badge: warm beige / sand / muted orange accent
    Comfort badge: soft green accent
    uppercase label text
    medium letter spacing
    compact horizontal badge shape
    Card layout
    
    Each card should contain:
    
    top badge label
    headline
    descriptive paragraph
    product image
    bullet list with 3 main benefits
    short italic/helper line: “Vhodné pro: …”
    CTA button at bottom
    Left card content
    
    Badge: BAREFOOT
    Headline: “Přirozená chůze”
    Text: “Tenká a flexibilní podrážka vám nechá vnímat terén a aktivně zapojit chodidlo. Pro ty, kdo chtějí co nejbližší pocit chůze naboso.”
    Benefits:
    
    tenká podrážka 2–5 mm
    maximální ohebnost
    výrazný kontakt se zemí
    Helper text:
    “Vhodné pro: milovníky přirozeného pohybu a zkušenější barefoot chodce.”
    Button:
    “Barefoot boty →”
    Right card content
    
    Badge: COMFORT
    Headline: “Měkčí došlap, stejné principy”
    Text: “Naše specialita: všechny výhody barefootu, ale s trojnásobně změkčeným došlapem. Ideální na město, beton i pro ty, kdo chtějí větší pohodlí.”
    Benefits:
    
    anatomická špička a zero drop
    měkčí dopad při chůzi
    pohodlí na tvrdém povrchu
    Helper text:
    “Vhodné pro: chůzi po městě, celodenní nošení a začátky s barefoot principy.”
    Button:
    “Comfort boty →”
    Bottom note
    
    Below the cards, add a centered supporting sentence:
    
    “Nejste si jistí? Začněte Comfort řadou. Chcete-li maximum přirozeného vjemu, zvolte Barefoot.”
    Design direction
    premium
    minimal
    elegant
    soft editorial layout
    beige neutral background
    subtle contrast between both cards
    rounded corners
    clean spacing
    visually stronger category distinction through badge design
    Styling requirements
    Each card should have its own soft-tinted background:
    Barefoot: warm beige / peach-tinted neutral
    Comfort: very light sage / green-tinted neutral
    CTA buttons should match each card accent color
    Use subtle shadows or borders
    Product images should sit in a soft framed image container
    Responsive requirements
    Desktop: 2 columns
    Mobile: stack cards vertically
    Badges must remain visually prominent on mobile
    Maintain strong hierarchy for headings and buttons
    Add separate mobile typography controls in Shopify schema
    Shopify requirements
    
    Build this as a fully editable Shopify section using Liquid, HTML, CSS, and minimal JavaScript if needed.
    
    Add theme editor settings for:
    
    all texts
    both product images
    both button labels and links
    badge text
    badge colors
    card background colors
    desktop/mobile typography
    spacing
    
    The badge design for BAREFOOT and COMFORT is especially important: make it feel like a real UI label/pill element, not just a small line of text. Make the Barefoot and Comfort labels look like premium category tags with a filled or lightly tinted badge background, instead of plain typography.Visually redesign the “BAREFOOT” and “COMFORT” labels as prominent rounded badges/pills with tinted background, accent color, small dot/icon, and uppercase text. Do not render them as plain text. All visual colors must be exposed as editable color settings in the Shopify schema, with sensible default values but no hardcoded final styling.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-barefoot-comfort-comparison-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.section_bg_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px 20px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-comparison-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.container_max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-comparison-intro-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.intro_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-comparison-main-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.main_heading_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.main_heading_weight }};
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.heading_spacing }}px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .ai-comparison-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subheading_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.subheading_weight }};
    color: {{ block.settings.subheading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.subheading_spacing }}px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .ai-comparison-supporting-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.supporting_text_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-comparison-cards-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: {{ block.settings.cards_gap }}px;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.bottom_note_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-comparison-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: var(--card-bg);
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    padding: {{ block.settings.card_padding }}px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    box-shadow: {{ block.settings.card_shadow }};
    border: {{ block.settings.card_border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
  }

  .ai-comparison-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: {{ block.settings.badge_padding_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.badge_padding_horizontal }}px;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.badge_border_radius }}px;
    background-color: var(--badge-bg);
    color: var(--badge-color);
    font-size: {{ block.settings.badge_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.badge_font_weight }};
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.badge_letter_spacing }}px;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.badge_spacing }}px;
    width: fit-content;
  }

  .ai-comparison-badge-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.badge_dot_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.badge_dot_size }}px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: var(--badge-color);
  }

  .ai-comparison-card-headline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.card_headline_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.card_headline_weight }};
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.card_headline_spacing }}px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .ai-comparison-card-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.card_text_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.card_text_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-comparison-image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.image_spacing }}px;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.image_bg_color }};
  }

  .ai-comparison-image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }
  .ai-comparison-image-link-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
  }

  .ai-comparison-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.benefits_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-comparison-benefit-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.benefit_item_spacing }}px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.benefit_text_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .ai-comparison-benefit-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .ai-comparison-benefit-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.benefit_icon_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.benefit_icon_size }}px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .ai-comparison-benefit-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    fill: var(--badge-bg);
  }

  .ai-comparison-helper-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.helper_text_size }}px;
    font-style: italic;
    color: {{ block.settings.helper_text_color }};
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.helper_text_spacing }}px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .ai-comparison-cta-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: {{ block.settings.button_padding_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.button_padding_horizontal }}px;
    background-color: var(--button-bg);
    color: var(--button-color);
    border: none;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.button_font_weight }};
    text-decoration: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .ai-comparison-cta-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: var(--button-hover-bg);
    color: var(--button-hover-color);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .ai-comparison-bottom-note-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.bottom_note_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-comparison-card-barefoot-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    --card-bg: {{ block.settings.barefoot_card_bg }};
    --badge-bg: {{ block.settings.barefoot_badge_bg }};
    --badge-color: {{ block.settings.barefoot_badge_color }};
    --button-bg: {{ block.settings.barefoot_button_bg }};
    --button-color: {{ block.settings.barefoot_button_color }};
    --button-hover-bg: {{ block.settings.barefoot_button_hover_bg }};
    --button-hover-color: {{ block.settings.barefoot_button_hover_color }};
  }

  .ai-comparison-card-comfort-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    --card-bg: {{ block.settings.comfort_card_bg }};
    --badge-bg: {{ block.settings.comfort_badge_bg }};
    --badge-color: {{ block.settings.comfort_badge_color }};
    --button-bg: {{ block.settings.comfort_button_bg }};
    --button-color: {{ block.settings.comfort_button_color }};
    --button-hover-bg: {{ block.settings.comfort_button_hover_bg }};
    --button-hover-color: {{ block.settings.comfort_button_hover_color }};
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
    .ai-comparison-main-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.main_heading_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-comparison-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.subheading_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-comparison-supporting-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.supporting_text_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-comparison-cards-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: {{ block.settings.cards_gap_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-comparison-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.card_padding_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-comparison-card-headline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.card_headline_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-comparison-card-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.card_text_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-comparison-benefit-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.benefit_text_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-comparison-bottom-note-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.bottom_note_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-comparison-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.badge_font_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-comparison-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size_mobile }}px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-barefoot-comfort-comparison-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-comparison-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-comparison-intro-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.main_heading != blank %}
        <h2 class="ai-comparison-main-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.main_heading }}</h2>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.subheading != blank %}
        <div class="ai-comparison-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.subheading }}</div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.supporting_text != blank %}
        <div class="ai-comparison-supporting-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.supporting_text }}</div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="ai-comparison-cards-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-comparison-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-comparison-card-barefoot-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-comparison-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <span class="ai-comparison-badge-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></span>
          <span>{{ block.settings.barefoot_badge_text }}</span>
        </div>

        {% if block.settings.barefoot_headline != blank %}
          <h3 class="ai-comparison-card-headline-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.barefoot_headline }}</h3>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.barefoot_text != blank %}
          <div class="ai-comparison-card-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.barefoot_text }}</div>
        {% endif %}

         {% if block.settings.barefoot_image_link != blank %}
          <a href="{{ block.settings.barefoot_image_link }}" class="ai-comparison-image-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.barefoot_image %}
          <div class="ai-comparison-image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <img
              src="{{ block.settings.barefoot_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
              alt="{{ block.settings.barefoot_image.alt | escape }}"
              loading="lazy"
              width="{{ block.settings.barefoot_image.width }}"
              height="{{ block.settings.barefoot_image.height }}"
            >
          </div>
        {% else %}
          <div class="ai-comparison-image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.barefoot_image_link != blank %}
          </a>
        {% endif %}

        <ul class="ai-comparison-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
